==Strategy==
An incredibly hard fight against Homulilly awaits. If she advances halfway across the stage, the player's base is forfeit unless you can knock her off with the Sniper item.

Although Li'l Homura may not be deployed in this stage, [[My Very Best Friend (Combo)|her Combo]] with [[Li'l Madoka (Rare Cat)|Li'l Madoka]] can still be activated, granting a very powerful edge against Homulilly.

[[:Category:Cats with Weaken Immunity|Weaken immune cats]] and [[:Category:Cats with Knockback Immunity|Knockback immune cats]], especially [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rares]], are very helpful against Homulily.

If you have any of the Uber Rare Cats from the [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event/Gacha Drop|collab pool]], bring them to this stage along with the My Very Best Friend Combo, they'll help a lot due to their [[Witch Killer]].

